<contentList>
	<content contentuid="hac081b9eg7527g46dbgb3a0g19282911b643" version="1">Rellavar's Brand</content>
	<content contentuid="hc6320e7fg9214g47c6g813eg523c629336b5" version="1">Dealing damage to foes &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_FROST"&gt;Encrusted with Frost&lt;/LSTag&gt; applies &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="WEAPON112"&gt;Mark of Frost&lt;/LSTag&gt; to them for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>
	<content contentuid="h00124702ge318g425dgbe4ega2db2f1acc15" version="1">Rellavar's Ice Trap</content>
	<content contentuid="hdbb4accfg9b1dg4dc7ga7feg36f192a7ea19" version="1">If a foe you damage has &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; or more turns of &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_FROST"&gt;Encrusted with Frost&lt;/LSTag&gt; left, it must succeed on a Dexterity &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; against your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;Potency DC&lt;/LSTag&gt; or be &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="FROZEN"&gt;Frozen&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turns.</content>
</contentList>
